* <1st Oct 2026> - <15990649> - <Krithika> - Shared COMMON for the multi-threaded B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP
*          batch: B.SCB.SM.STMP.DTY.UPD.LOAD resolves these once before threading starts,
*          B.SCB.STMP.DTY.EXEP (the worker) reuses them on every threaded call instead of
*          re-opening the file / re-resolving the local ref position per id.
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

